note as BIZ_diagram_25_pharmacy_inventory
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Prevents overselling and untraceable adjustments under concurrent manual,
  API, dispensing and receiving operations. The immutable ledger is the source
  of truth; stock positions are transactional projections optimized for reads.
end note

